sequenceDiagram
    participant vLLM as vLLM Model Servers<br/>8200/TCP HTTP
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>9090/TCP HTTPS
    participant KEDA as KEDA<br/>Bearer Token Auth
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant HPA as HorizontalPodAutoscaler
    participant Deploy as Inference Deployments

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over vLLM,Deploy: Flow 1: KEDA Blueprint Autoscaling (Current Architecture)
        vLLM->>Prom: Export inference metrics<br/>8200/TCP HTTP (in-cluster)
        KEDA->>Prom: Query metrics (queue depth, KV-cache)<br/>9090/TCP HTTPS, Bearer token
        Prom-->>KEDA: Metric values
        KEDA->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HPA<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS, ServiceAccount
        K8sAPI-->>HPA: HPA resource created
        HPA->>K8sAPI: Scale subresource update<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS, ServiceAccount
        K8sAPI-->>Deploy: Replica count adjusted
    end

    participant WVA as WVA Controller (Legacy)<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(245, 235, 235)
        Note over vLLM,Deploy: Flow 2: WVA Controller Autoscaling (Legacy, Deprecated)
        WVA->>Prom: Query inference metrics<br/>9090/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Bearer token / mTLS
        Prom-->>WVA: Metric values
        WVA->>K8sAPI: Watch InferencePool, HPA, ScaledObject<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS, ServiceAccount
        K8sAPI-->>WVA: Resource events
        WVA->>K8sAPI: Scale Deployment/LWS<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS, ServiceAccount
        K8sAPI-->>Deploy: Replica count adjusted
        Prom->>WVA: Scrape /metrics<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS<br/>TokenReview + SAR
        WVA-->>Prom: Controller metrics
    end
